recorded inside the car.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:09.500
So on this x-axis on the table, I'm going to vary the data set.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:15.870
On this other axis, I'm going to label different ways

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:17.870
or algorithms for examining the data.

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:20.870
So first, there's human level performance,

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:25.870
which is how accurate are humans on each of these data sets.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:36.270
Then there is the error on examples that your neural network has trained on.

