between these two numbers, these two numbers, and these two numbers.

00:14:55.970 --> 00:15:01.970
And this gap here is a measure of avoidable bias.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:06.970
This gap here is a measure of variance,

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:12.970
and this gap here was a measure of data mismatch.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:17.970
But it turns out that it could be useful to also fill in the remaining

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:20.970
two entries in this table.

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:24.970
And so if this turns out to be also 6%,

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:28.970
and the way you get this number is you ask some humans to label their rearview

